{"parse": {"title": "末日与末日之后-05", "pageid": 101318, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-04\" title=\"末日与末日之后-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">末日与末日之后-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-06\" title=\"末日与末日之后-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">末日与末日之后</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.BE.80.E6.98.94\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"往昔\">往昔</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 往昔</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Days of Yore</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>好了，好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几次闪烁后，屋内的灯再次亮了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>你可真厉害，是在哪里学过怎么倒腾这些机械吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对妇人赞扬的目光，库珀花环迟疑了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您是否听说过那些关于末日的说法？<br />我过去对此深信不疑，研究过许多像是自制发电机、野外求生的知识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我曾以为只要我做好最周全的准备，就能够让我身边的一切幸免于难。<br />但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>它们最终并没有起到任何作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这并不是库珀花环现在乐于谈论的话题，她环顾起四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以“家”来说，少了些生活气息；以“度假小屋”来说，又似乎过于简陋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>说起来，这里是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>猎熊人留下的小屋，叫我改造了一番，添置了许多东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>不过这里仍属于每一个疲惫的过路人，大家都可以进来暖暖身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>察觉到库珀花环带着疑问的眼神，妇人笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>奇怪我来这种前不着村后不着店的地方做什么？<br />其实是为了一件私事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>从西北边的扎波利亚尔内市再往西十公里，有一个钻井项目。 <br />我是那里的医生，我丈夫则是那里的机械师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>那可离这里有些距离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>是呀，跋涉了半天才到这里，没想到天公却这样不作美。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人望向依然呼啸着饕风虐雪的窗外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>看起来雪一时半会儿停不了……就当作打发时间吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>这一切要从好些年前说起了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>那时我和我丈夫还年轻，在城里各自有份不错的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>但有一天，他拿着一沓文件风风火火地跑回家——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>看看这个，这群家伙真是疯子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>他们想要挖一口深井，挖穿大地、直到地底最深处……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>不是为了寻找石油或是其他的矿藏，只是为了看看这颗星球的内层究竟藏着些什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>你说说，还有比这更傻的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男子兴高采烈地指上文件上的某一行，露出灿烂的笑脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>他们正在召集人手，机械师和医生都缺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>怎么样？<br />你觉得呢，拉瑞莎？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>我们就这样乘着车来到了那片雪原，一待就是好几年，连我们的第一个孩子都是在宿舍里出生的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>呵呵，你会不会觉得这样很傻？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>怎么会呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>地心也好，宇宙的尽头也罢，尝试弄清楚那里究竟是什么的努力一定是有意义的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这样浩大的工作一个人是完不成的。<br />但如果每个人都做些自己力所能及的事，就不是不可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>阿尔谢尼——也就是我丈夫，也经常说一样的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从妇人黯淡下去的笑容中，库珀花环察觉了端倪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>难道项目并不顺利吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>我们的确遇到了许多未曾设想过的困难，但最终大伙都能众志成城地战胜它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>那口井越挖越深，我们相信我们总有一天能够一探地底的秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>直到他们说——我们挖开了地狱之门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-626320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-626320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-626320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">钻井工人Ⅰ：</div><div>我听过了，那毫无疑问是来自地狱的声音！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">钻井工人Ⅱ：</div><div>你那算什么，我可是真的遇到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">钻井工人Ⅱ：</div><div>那天晚上我在外面抽烟，看到狗舍那边有个异常高大的人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">钻井工人Ⅱ：</div><div>当时我没在意，但仔细想想，人怎么可能有两三米高？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">钻井工人Ⅱ：</div><div>结果那几条狗的死状你们也看到了——它当时离我只有十几米啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-626320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-626320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-626320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">钻井工人Ⅰ：</div><div>我们得停下！<br />不然天晓得我们会把什么东西放出来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群骚动了起来，惶恐在不断蔓延。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但它们最终被一个清朗的笑声盖了过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>好了好了，同志们！<br />你们不会真的相信那种玩笑话吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>那天的不过是风声而已。<br />至于那头恶熊，雅科夫他们几个也已经在追捕了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>我知道最近大家都有些累了，但振作些呀，同志们！<br />咱们不是培训过吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>我们脚下的是地壳，再往下是地幔，中间的是莫霍面……你们说，这地狱是要塞到哪层去？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有时人们只是需要这样一个声音，那些不安的涟漪逐渐平息了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>阿尔谢尼就是那样，从十几岁时我们认识开始就没有变过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>有的时候想起一出是一出，像个小孩子一样叫人头疼；但当他走在前面时，又叫大伙都忍不住想要跟着他一起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人的眼中闪着自豪，但她的笑容却逐渐淡了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>……可也许他不该那样出挑的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>那天晚上，我被叫去照顾一名突发高烧的工人，留下阿尔谢尼在宿舍照看我们的大女儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>第二天早上，他被人发现倒在雪地里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>血从屋里一路拖到外面，我们的孩子也不见了踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>他们说，这是来自地狱的惩罚。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "末日与末日之后-05"}}